{
  "$comment": [
    "Command → outcome inventory of the GitHub integration: every `gh`",
    "invocation `src-tauri/src/github.rs` can run, whether it mutates, what",
    "confirmation stands in front of it, what parses its answer, who consumes",
    "it, and how it is validated. `tests/github-command-inventory.test.mjs`",
    "checks this file against the source: a public gh-backed function missing",
    "here — or listed here but gone from the code — fails the suite, and every",
    "cited evidence file must exist.",
    "",
    "`validation.live` values: `done (offline)` needs no live run; a test name",
    "means the supervised sandbox suite covers it (src-tauri/tests/",
    "github_live.rs, run per docs/github-sandbox-runbook.md); `pending:` names",
    "what still blocks a first live execution."
  ],
